OL,3,AUS markets about to reopen after AI
OL,4,Aslowdown fears sent tech stocks
OL,5,Aplummeting worldwide
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe value of tech stocks has plummeted
OL,8,Faround the world amid fears of a
OL,9,Fslowdown in AI development - all eyes
OL,10,Fwill shortly be on the US where markets
OL,11,Fare due to reopen at 14:30 GMT (09:30
OL,12,FET)
OL,14,FThe Nasdaq index, of the largest tech
OL,15,Ffirms listed in the US, was down by
OL,16,Fmore than 5.5% on Thursday; Japan's
OL,17,FNikkei 225 was down 6.3% earlier; and
OL,18,Fthe UK's FTSE 100 index has fallen by
OL,19,Faround 2.2%
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
